    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">YALE UNIVERSITY<lb/><rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__770" type="place">NEW HAVEN</rs>
                        <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__726" type="place">CONNECTICUT</rs><lb/>PIERSON
                        COLLEGE<lb/>THE MASTER</fw><dateline><date when="1945-10-29">October
                            29th<lb/>1945</date><note type="ea">Unter dem Datum steht
                            handschriftlich: <q><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__846" type="person"
                                    >Heiman</rs></q>.</note></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">
                        Paulus</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>I now have an opportunity to suggest to an officer in military government in <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__37" type="place">Berlin</rs> the names of <q>reliable
                    persons whom I knew when I was living in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__37"
                        type="place">Berlin</rs> before the Nazis came into power.</q> Have you any
                    names to suggest? If they are people I did not know, I would have to have a
                    brief description from you.</p>
                <p>I enjoyed the stay at your apartment the other day as much as ever. I can&apos;t tell
                    you how much those hours of conversation mean to me every time. I love to have
                        <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person">Hannah</rs> in on them
                    because of her particular point of view and type of question.</p>
                <closer><salute>With kindest regards to all of you, also from <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__2400" type="person"
                        >Doris</rs>,</salute><signed>As ever yours, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__2094" type="person">Arnold </rs></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
